     "<span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">hi all,</span><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">This is the 2nd announcement for the workshop listed in the Subject.</span><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">See details here:</span><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><a style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(17,85,204);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\" href=\"http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewtopic.php?f=8&amp;t=2366&amp;sid=6e5a9fa91fc3d48e20568427459b42b3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewtopic.php?f%3D8%26t%3D2366%26sid%3D6e5a9fa91fc3d48e20568427459b42b3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792495354658000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lNIfvgvzUVafIOSx_P7he\"><u>http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewtopic.php?f=8&amp;t=2366&amp;sid=6e5a9fa91fc3d48e20568427459b42b3</u></a><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">We still have space available. The workshop covers Bayesian analyses </span><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">using BUGS and JAGS software of a wide variety of models that are </span><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">useful for population ecologists and managers, e.g., Poisson GLMMs, </span><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">state-space models, closed population models, Cormack-Jolly-Seber and </span><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Jolly-Seber models, multistate models, ring-recovery models,</span><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">integrated population models and hierarchical models for distribution </span><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">and abundance in structured populations (i.e., site-occupancy and N-</span><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">mixture models).</span><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">The workshop is based on the recent book by Kery and Schaub, &quot;Bayesian </span><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Population Analysis using WinBUGS&quot;, published by Academic Press in </span><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">2012, a copy of which will be handed out to each participant.</span><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Please also note the possibility to apply for a Jim Nichols Travel </span><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Award; see<span> </span></span><a style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(17,85,204);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\" href=\"http://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/workshops/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/workshops/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792495354658000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0B4pwcfdLbPhh-c6MhAPk4\"><u>www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/workshops/</u></a><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span> </span>for more information.</span><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Kind regards  --</span><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Andy (for Marc and Michael)</span>"
